title: Is it resolved when the buffer is saved, or by a command at the point?
pid: 2d8828f7-d38e-4bc8-bd2e-fb39bf09a8c2
body: |2-
  At save, the save asks about each ambiguous one, as it already asks
  about forks and retyped headlines; a command asks at once, one at a
  time. If he does not say, at save, since his example is writing
  without stopping.
